## Build and system components

Cython 3.3.0 is a build tool, not an installed runtime dependency. Its upstream
COPYING.txt explicitly states that embedded compiler output snippets do not impose
license restrictions on the output. Its COPYING and Apache-2.0 license texts are
included for traceability; this does not declare the AMHSTrafficLab core Apache-2.0.

CPython, glibc, the display/OpenGL stack and libstdc++ are environment components,
not included in this wheel. The validation environment used Ubuntu's
libstdc++6 12.3.0-1ubuntu1~22.04.3 (GCC runtime licensing with applicable exceptions).
Upstream terms: https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/libstdc++/manual/license.html
The runtime supplement is not part of this release directory or wheel. Anyone
redistributing a runtime or container must also retain its package-specific
copyright, license and applicable source-delivery materials.

